<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise owns around 99 pct of Elyo.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise owns around 99 pct of Elyo.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French utility Lyonnaise des Eaux said on Monday it owned close to 99 percent of Elyo after completing a buyout offer for the heating and energy subsidiary.</p>
<p>In a statement Lyonnaise des Eaux also said it would soon ask stock market authorities to withdraw Elyo from listing on the Paris bourse.</p>
<p>The 330 francs per share buyout offer closed on February 4.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
